<Layout title="Service Request and Ticket Resolution Process Mining | RE-ViVE" description="Why do two identical requests resolve at different speeds? RE-ViVE reconstructs ticket execution across queues, teams and tools to show reassignments and waits." current="/process-service-resolution">
<Fragment slot="head">
